## Agent Intake Template

When reports arrive, each report must be converted into:

| Finding | Module | Layer | Evidence | Severity | Fix Type | Owner Service | DB Impact | Test Required |
| ------- | ------ | ----- | -------- | -------- | -------- | ------------- | --------- | ------------- |

Severity:

* `P0`: blocks login/workspace/module render
* `P1`: blocks module function or demo quality
* `P2`: warning, cosmetic, deprecated API, observability improvement

Fix type:

* Route mapping
* Frontend endpoint correction
* Backend handler implementation
* DB migration
* Seed data
* AuthZ/RBAC
* Workflow/event
* UI rendering
* Observability

